  "title": "Creamed Cottage Cheese Pie",
  "description": "This pie has a lighter flavor than a traditional cream cheese one, and there are raisins and nuts that give the cottage cheese a wonderful texture. It bakes up brown and beautiful. Top it with fresh blueberries or strawberries.",
  "authors": [
    "Jo dw"
  ],
